          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شخر (shakhara) is built on the native Arabic root sh-kh-r, \"to snort\" (Lane). Lane gives shakhara, aor. yashkhiru, as a snorting sound from the nose or throat."
